identifiers:
  - type: url
    value: 'https://github.com/joelparkerhenderson/fhirpg/'
    description: >-
      A command-line utility that imports HL7 FHIR data into a PostgreSQL
      database and stores it relationally. A Rust translation of fhirbase.
repository-code: 'https://github.com/joelparkerhenderson/fhirpg/'
abstract: >-
  fhirpg imports HL7 FHIR data into a PostgreSQL database and stores it
  relationally: one table per resource type, resource bodies as jsonb, with
  history tables and stored procedures for create, read, update, and delete.
  It is a Rust translation of fhirbase, a Go utility by Health Samurai, and is
  released under the MIT License with attribution to that work. HL7, FHIR, and
  the FHIR [FLAME DESIGN] are registered trademarks of Health Level Seven
  International, and their use does not constitute endorsement by HL7.
keywords:
  - FHIR
  - PostgreSQL
  - healthcare
  - interoperability
  - Rust
